    atlas:verify "`python3 tools/driver.py status`; `node tools/census.js ../demo/src > c.json`; then `python3 -I -c \"import json;c=set(json.load(open('c.json'))['defs']);n=json.load(open('NODES.json'))['nodes'];print(len(c),len([x for x in c if x in n]))\"`" .

