<drill/D-CAS-5> a atlas:Drill ;
    atlas:answer "`E=1 W=0 I=1`, `KHR_LIGHTS_PUNCTUAL_LIGHT_SPOT_ANGLES @ /extensions/KHR_lights_punctual/lights/2/spot/outerConeAngle`. The exporter writes the inner angle just inside the cone (`x3dcastleexport.pas:1896-1903`); X3D lets `beamWidth` reach `cutOffAngle` (\"no falloff inside the cone\"), glTF does not." ;
