<drill/D-TRC-4> a atlas:Drill ;
    atlas:answer "(a) `check`, `verified`, `check` (the leading `v` is BUG-48, open). (b) `verified` for all three: the first is BUG-45, open. (c) Components may be separated only by whitespace, commas, `x`, `by`, `and` and a unit word; anything else caps the item at `reworded`, because a value assembled from scattered numbers is Likely at best. The rule must keep `5 m east and 7 m north` for `5 0 7` at `reworded`." ;
    atlas:checkedOn "2026-11-16"^^xsd:date ;
    atlas:checkedText "2026-11-16 `x3dtrace` dcba70d7, Python 3.13.18" ;
