    atlas:level "L2" ;
    atlas:line 528 ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <doc/x3d.docs@ff0565e/docs/learn/12-unreal-tier1.md> ;
    atlas:status "ran" ;
    atlas:task "write `P = [[1,0,0],[0,0,1],[0,1,0]]`, compute `det P`, then the determinant of the alternative `Q = [[1,0,0],[0,0,1],[0,-1,0]]`. Convert the UE yaw 90 degrees rotation `[[0,-1,0],[1,0,0],[0,0,1]]` to X3D with `P R P` and read the axis-angle." ;
    atlas:title "Derive and check the axis swap" ;
    atlas:verify "`python3 -c \"import numpy as np; ...\"` with `np.linalg.det`; axis from `R[2][1]-R[1][2]`, `R[0][2]-R[2][0]`, `R[1][0]-R[0][1]`." .

<drill/D-UNR-2> a atlas:Drill ;
    atlas:answer "0.6045 rad (34.63 degrees); for the lens, horizontal 37.50 degrees and vertical 21.62 degrees at 16:9." ;
    atlas:checkedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    atlas:checkedText "2026-11-14 Python 3." ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.docs/blob/ff0565e5a248ca391d68527716a58a821f25d152/docs/learn/12-unreal-tier1.md?plain=1#L535> ;
    atlas:inChapter <chapter/12> ;
    rdfs:label "D-UNR-2 Convert a field of view" ;
    atlas:level "L1" ;
    atlas:line 535 ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <doc/x3d.docs@ff0565e/docs/learn/12-unreal-tier1.md> ;
    atlas:status "ran" ;
    atlas:task "a camera has a horizontal field of view of 58 degrees on a 16:9 image. What `fieldOfView` (radians) does X3D need? What is it for a 35 mm lens on a 23.76 mm sensor?" ;
    atlas:title "Convert a field of view" ;
    atlas:verify "`python3 -c \"import math; h=math.radians(58); print(2*math.atan(math.tan(h/2)/(16/9)))\"`." .

<drill/D-UNR-3> a atlas:Drill ;
    atlas:answer "before `(0,0,1)`; after `(0,-1,0)`; `P n = (0,1,0)`. They differ in sign, so the right-handed cross-product normal is not carried by the mirror. A converter must pick index order by a numeric test against the engine's front-face rule, and `solid='false'` hides a wrong pick." ;
    atlas:checkedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    atlas:checkedText "2026-11-14 Python 3 with numpy." ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/hagopjay/x3d.docs/blob/ff0565e5a248ca391d68527716a58a821f25d152/docs/learn/12-unreal-tier1.md?plain=1#L542> ;
