    atlas:failure "\"Limits written before the run\" could not be shown: limit and declared_limit are written by the same run from the same value" ;
    atlas:fix "Commit the limits file first; the runner refuses to start if it differs from its commit and writes the commit and the file's sha256 into every record (x3d.demo v6 `tmp6.py`). The physics witness now checks that block (`PHYS_LIMITS_UNPROVEN`). Git history can still be rewritten by its owner and a commit date is editable; say so" ;
