    atlas:failure "The X_ITE freeze (failure mode 88) on a second delivery, one not built under the Loom: one exception from the slide show's conductor stopped the piece for good. The clock advanced 1.5 s in 1.5 s before the throw and 0 s in 2 s after; the scene's TimeSensor stopped; a callback added afterwards was never called; seeking moved the playhead, which then stood still. The delivered feature checks and a clean console never exercise this path, and the earlier director page has the same callback" ;
    atlas:fix "A guard in both pages, as a fold-back patch (`runs/mashtots2-20261105/foldback/stage-onframe-guard.patch`), applied to the demo copy (`projects/mashtots-slideshow`) on 5 Nov at the user's word; and committed to the source repo (`~/Projects/x3d/work/mashtots-standalones/slideshow`, eae4235). With it, the clock advanced 2.0 s in 2.0 s past the same throw, the feature checks pass 150 of 150, and page traps pass. The resilience probe belongs in every X_ITE page's evidence, not only in the Loom's own studies" ;
    atlas:inClass <class/K5> ;
    rdfs:label "Failure mode 94" ;
    atlas:line 486 ;
    atlas:mentions <fm/88> ;
    atlas:n 94 ;
